  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The classic version uses gnocchi made from scratch, but good-quality fresh gnocchi from the supermarket chiller works just as well here. The dish is about a simple tomato sauce, molten mozzarella, and soft gnocchi -- none of which needs to be complex."
          }
        ]
      },
